  topicId: intrinsic
  title: Intrinsic Si/Ge
  summary: 'Pure Group IV crystal (4 valence electrons). At 0 K it has no free carriers (insulator). Heat breaks covalent bonds so n = p = ni (Si: 1.5e10 cm^-3, Eg = 1.12 eV at 300 K).'
  explanationLine: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 410dc3f4c67ac4f4e8bf19ea54723354, type: 2}
